  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/5218E0">Proposition <span data-tag="5218E0">4.4.5.12</span>.</a> Let $\calC $ be an $\infty $-category, and let $F: \Idem ^{+} \rightarrow \calC $ be a strong retraction diagram. Then $F$ is a left Kan extension of $F| \Idem $. </p>
